WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.226
What is a power of sale?

00:00:02.426 --> 00:00:06.577
It’s when a lender sells a home because the owner stopped paying the mortgage.

00:00:07.626 --> 00:00:10.885
After missed payments, the lender sends a formal notice.

00:00:11.086 --> 00:00:14.580
If the debt isn’t paid, the lender can list the home and sell it.

00:00:15.629 --> 00:00:17.998
These homes are usually sold as is.

00:00:18.199 --> 00:00:23.903
The lender never lived there, so it won’t promise anything about the condition, or what’s left inside.

00:00:24.953 --> 00:00:26.312
So check carefully.

00:00:26.512 --> 00:00:30.300
A home inspection, the title and any liens, and your financing.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.300
Our agent and lawyer look at these before you offer.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:38.633
The lender has to aim for fair market value, so it’s not always a bargain.

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:43.785
Browse power of sale homes on Titled, and buy alone or with people you trust.
